ested columns; column_concept_total_units' decision guide directs subject-offering-rollup unit statistics to SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY.TOTAL_UNITS; concept_department_dimension directs degree-granting filters to SIS_DEPARTMENT.\n- *Business*: Both top-10-reserved precedents (dw_3356, dw_3664) use the identical join path and grouping; the question is dw_3356's wording plus \"total units,\" so the minimal faithful extension is adding TOTAL_UNITS to the same CTE.\n\n**6d. Alternatives**: Adding `s.TERM_CODE='2009SP'` to the summary join or using MAX(TOTAL_UNITS) instead of including it in GROUP BY would change the precedent's population/grouping; the precedent-faithful choice (TOTAL_UNITS in GROUP BY) is selected because both stored precedents define the top-10 population without a term filter on the summary side.\n\n",
